OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest made after woman
OL,4,Afound dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder following the death of a woman
OL,8,Fin Nottinghamshire.
OL,10,FA woman in her 50s was found dead at a
OL,11,Fproperty in James Close, Ollerton,
OL,12,Fshortly before 20:00 BST on Sunday,
OL,13,FNottinghamshire Police said.
OL,15,FA 60-year-old man was later arrested on
OL,16,Fsuspicion of murder.
OL,18,FDet Insp Stuart Barson appealed for
OL,19,Fanyone with information to come
OL,20,Fforward.
